  "notes": "COMPOUND: {本|ほん} (real, true) + ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧ (spirit, feeling)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {本気|ほんき}⟦で→で：00502_de⟧ (seriously, in earnest)\n- {本気|ほんき}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧ (to get serious)\n- {本気|ほんき}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧ (to get serious, show one's true ability)\n- {本気|ほんき}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to take seriously)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{真剣|しんけん}→真剣：01565_shinken⟧ (serious, earnest - more formal)\n- ⟦マジ→マジ：04744_maji⟧ (seriously - slang, from {本気|まじ})\n- ⟦{冗談|じょうだん}→冗談：03347_joudan⟧ (joke - antonym)\n\nCOLLOQUIAL READING: ⟦マジ→マジ：04744_maji⟧ comes from {本気|まじ}, an alternative reading used in casual speech.",
